{
  "_source": "synthetic",
  "_note": "Juspay 3DS server profile. Hand-written from the SDK's external-3DS handling: /confirm answers requires_customer_action + next_action three_ds_invoke (src/Utilities/PaymentHelpers.res) -> fullscreen '3ds' (src/ThreeDSMethod.res, only when three_ds_method_data_submission) -> fullscreen '3dsAuth' (src/ThreeDSAuth.res) -> POST /payments/:id/3ds/authentication. trans_status C: the SDK POSTs the CReq to acs_url inside #threeDsAuthFrame (acsChallenge = stand-in ACS page with an OTP field, Pay and Cancel); trans_status Y: the SDK POSTs to three_ds_authorize_url. The router's authorize page (threeDsAuthorize) postMessages openurl_if_required, which the SDK turns into a force-sync retrieve and resolves confirmPayment; it also moves the hermetic intent to succeeded / failed (cancel). Outcomes are keyed on the test card sent to /confirm (the scenario is stored on the intent as hermetic_3ds). The fullscreen iframes call GlobalVars.backendEndPoint (https://beta.hyperswitch.io/api) rather than the merchant's custom backend; the engine strips that /api prefix, so plain router paths match. No 3DS method for either card (threeds_method_comp_ind U).",
